Z||000005||California Kid||12-08-2001||12:24 PM||||Thanks guys! The main reason I posted these pics is to show what a little extra clear coat can do for paint. Painter laid 2-3 coats up wet and heavy, wet sanded and polished.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/californiakidsig_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000006||FieroJoe||12-08-2001||12:30 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by California Kid:<BR><B>Thanks guys! The main reason I posted these pics is to show what a little extra clear coat can do for paint. Painter laid 2-3 coats up wet and heavy, wet sanded and polished.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>That is the main reason why extra coats of clear are used.  That way, you sand sand the heck out of it and not worry about going through, and then polish it up really really shiney.<P>Looks great!<BR>||||reg||1
