Z||000012||California Kid||12-08-2001||11:11 PM||||Hey Ben, picture were taken with dust on it, car hasn't been washed in a month!! Couldn't get away with that when it was black! Car was fully block sanded before disassembley for paint, panels shot seperate lying flat for the most part, so clear could be put on thick.<P>"stingant0" heres a couple more pics.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> The shoes are my nasty 20 year old Dock Siders that I don't have the heart to pitch!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> No laces, great for jumping into to go to the garage.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/post_1.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/post_2.jpg">  <BR>These are the biggest I can post within site limits.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dance_2.gif"> <BR>Thanks for the compliments!!!<p>[This message has been edited by California Kid (edited 12-08-2001).]||||reg||1
